Willow & Sage — AI Image & Content Workflow

Project Overview

Willow & Sage is a fictional natural skincare brand created for an AI-powered image and content workflow project. This project demonstrates how AI tools can support visual content creation, prompt engineering, copywriting, image refinement, and promotional content development.

Project Objectives

* Develop a consistent visual identity for a skincare brand.
* Create AI-generated product and lifestyle imagery.
* Document prompts and image iterations.
* Refine visual assets through manual editing.
* Develop and human-edit marketing copy.
* Prepare a short promotional video.
* Review AI limitations, transparency, and responsible use.

Project Contents

* Brand Brief: Brand concept, audience, and visual direction.
* AI Images: Product photography concepts, skincare imagery, and lifestyle visuals.
* Prompt Log: Prompts and available generation details.
* Iteration Evidence: Three-image comparisons and prompt refinements.
* Manual Edit Evidence: Before-and-after editing records.
* Copywriting Tracker: AI drafts, human-edited copy, and editing rationale.
* Promotional Video: A 30-second video draft.
* Workflow Report: Process documentation, limitations, and observations.
* AI Disclosure & Credits: Transparency notes and third-party asset credits.

Workflow

1. Define the brand concept and visual direction.
2. Develop prompts for image generation.
3. Generate and review visual concepts.
4. Refine prompts and compare iterations.
5. Organize and document manual edits.
6. Draft and human-edit marketing copy.
7. Prepare promotional content.
8. Document limitations and AI usage.

Tools and Technologies

* Generative AI tools for visual and text content
* Spreadsheet software for prompt and copywriting logs
* Image-editing tools for visual refinement
* Video-editing tools for promotional content
* GitHub for project organization and version control

Specific tool versions and settings are documented only where available.

Important Notes

This is a portfolio and learning project based on a fictional brand. AI-generated content may contain visual inconsistencies and should be reviewed before commercial use. The promotional video in this repository is a draft; voiceover may need to be added separately.

AI Transparency

AI was used to assist with visual concepts, prompt development, and copywriting. Human review and editing are part of the documented workflow. Third-party assets, if used, should be credited appropriately.

Project Status

Status: Project documentation and creative assets prepared; final review and any remaining edits are required before publication.

Author

Created as an AI image and content workflow project for learning and portfolio development.
